&sort=created&order=desc&page\n\n```\nafter the upgrade the querystring changed to:\n\n```\n\nq=repo%3Ajanbaer%2Fhowcani%2Btype%3Aissue&sort=created&order=desc&page=1\n\n```\n\nThe url was build automatically by the http service with using the RequestOptions object and giving them the searchParams. One of the search params has the following value:\n\n```\n\nrepo:howcani-project/howcani-data+type:issue\n\n```\n\nI think the problem here is the usage of the slash and the plus sign. But it's necessary to send the search string in this format to github. https://developer.github.com/v3/search/\n\nHow can I prevent that my query value will by escaped?\n\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"jeffbcross","id":463703,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MzcwMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/463703?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffbcross","html_url":"https://github.com/jeffbcross","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffbcross/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffbcross/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffbcross/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffbcross/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffbcross/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffbcross/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffbcross/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffbcross/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeffbcross/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/9348/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/9348/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}